{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1222608001:0":{"text":"데이브! 지금 어딜 가나 그레이브본이 다시 돌아올 거라고, 죽음의 함대가 다시 쳐들어올 거라는 소리뿐이야!","source_cn":"老戴夫！我走到哪都能听见别人说亡灵又来了，死潮舰队又要来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE712FF09BF577172","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222608002:0":{"text":"러스트 항에 찾아온 평화를 망칠 셈이야?","source_cn":"你想毁了锈锚港好不容易才得到的安宁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F860501657B7395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222608003:0":{"text":"난 죽음의 함대 얘기는 꺼내지도 않았어!","source_cn":"我可从来没提过什么死潮舰队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B1ADFC8608A764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222608004:0":{"text":"하지만 여자 그레이브본은 봤단 말이야! 헛소문이 아니라, 진짜라고!","source_cn":"但我真的看见了女亡灵！那不是造谣，是事实！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C267F71295D1E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222608005:0":{"text":"헛소리하지 마. 네가 꾼 꿈이 진짜라도 되는 줄 아는 거야? 어젯밤에 난 죽음의 함대가 내 가게로 들어오는 꿈까지 꿨어. 그럼 그것도 진짜겠네?!","source_cn":"别发癔症，你把自己做的梦当真了。我昨晚还梦见死潮舰队走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63D455184DBA4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222608006:1":{"text":"그래서, 눈을 떠보니 오줌이라도 한 바가지 쌌던가?","source_cn":"怎么着，睁开眼你发现自己尿了一床吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E26B264B431B503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222608007:1":{"text":"빌어먹을! 그 생선 비린내 나는 입을 찢어버리고야 말겠어!","source_cn":"该死！我非得撕烂你这张鱼腥味的臭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3247AEDB743F0716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222608008:1":{"text":"...다들 그만!","source_cn":"——都别吵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6147D8C14F91BC69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222608009:1":{"text":"부두목? 마침 잘 오셨습니다. 이 녀석이...","source_cn":"二当家？你来得正好，这家伙他——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478DFC34C59A383E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222608010:1":{"text":"보르스, 여긴 내게 맡기고 가서 손님들이나 챙기도록 해.","source_cn":"波尔斯，这里交给我，去招呼你的客人们吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC46A9AC10185CD04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222608011:1":{"text":"...어휴!","source_cn":"……啧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80361BF17C15BBBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222608012:1":{"text":"흥, 겁쟁이!","source_cn":"哼，胆小鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FD25E6EF51D0AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222608013:0":{"text":"진정해. 데이브, 난 당신이 이런 일로 거짓말하지 않을 거라는 거 알아.","source_cn":"冷静点。老戴夫，我知道你不会为这种事撒谎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4039B759FD56B9A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222608014:1":{"text":"그 괴상한 걸 봤다던 그날 밤 있었던 일을 자세히 얘기해 주겠나?","source_cn":"我相信你看见了诡异的东西，详细讲讲那天晚上的遭遇吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D1AF4EB1495E92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222608015:1":{"text":"그건 괴상한 게 아니라, 그레이브본이라고!","source_cn":"连你也学会语言的艺术了啊？那可不是什么诡异的东西，那是亡灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC77A030C99A0FAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222608016:1":{"text":"그날 밤, 그물을 걷고 부두로 돌아와서 배를 묶어두는데 갑자기 부두에 그림자가 나타났어.","source_cn":"那天晚上，我收了网回到码头，正在栓船，突然看到码头上有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAD21262FDCD8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222608017:1":{"text":"한눈에도 예쁜 여자라는 걸 알 수 있었지. 적어도 내가 그 여자의 얼굴을 곧바로 쳐다보지 않았더라면...","source_cn":"我知道那是个女人，哼，一看就知道是个漂亮妞。要不是我马...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3D540A6273E159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222608018:1":{"text":"그녀의 피부는 죽은 물고기처럼 희고, 두 눈은 초록색 빛을 띠었어!","source_cn":"她的皮肤死鱼般灰白，还有两只闪着绿光的眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F883107E651FEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222608019:1":{"text":"그레이브본의 모습이 확실하네요. 많이 놀라셨겠어요.","source_cn":"的确是亡灵的样貌呢，你当时吓坏了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42B35DFEFD83008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222608020:1":{"text":"맞아... 휴... 정말 창피하군. 내 비명 소리 때문에 몇백 미터 밖의 물고기까지 놀라 도망갔을 거라니까!","source_cn":"是……真丢人啊，我惨叫一声，方圆几百码的鱼都要被我吓跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88FEAA1C21297C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222608021:1":{"text":"그 그레이브본은 나를 보았지만 날 죽이려고 하지는 않았어. 오히려 뒤를 돌아 어둠 속으로 사라지고 말았지...","source_cn":"那亡灵注意到我，但她竟然没要我的命，而是转身跳进夜色里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD220AB8FDC599D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222608022:1":{"text":"내 말에 일말의 거짓이라도 있다면 다음번 출항했을 때, 바로 파도에 휩쓸려 상어 먹이가 될 거라고 맹세하지!","source_cn":"我发誓，要有半点假话，下次我出海，立刻被浪头卷走喂鲨鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D452848421FD4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222608023:1":{"text":"와... 지킬 수 있는 약속이긴 한 거죠??","source_cn":"哇……真是个严肃的誓言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA713BEB88B0E728B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222608024:1":{"text":"루카, 이게 바로 내가 본 전부야. 이제 날 이해하겠나?!","source_cn":"卢卡，这就是我看见的一切。你们应该明白我的态度了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x394457DB35C13F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222608025:1":{"text":"난 죽음의 함대를 봤다고 하지도, 그 그레이브본이 죽음의 함대 사람이라고 하지도 않았어. 헛소문을 퍼트린 건 내가 아니라고!","source_cn":"我没见过死潮舰队，也没说过那亡灵是死潮的人。造谣的不是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6C01FE19BE0213","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222608026:1":{"text":"우리가 모든 걸 밝혀낼 걸세.","source_cn":"我们会查清这一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95A7BB635F91BCF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1222608027:1":{"text":"데이브, 블러디 로즈가 비밀리에 자네를 보호할 테니, 집으로 돌아가 잠시 피해있게.","source_cn":"老戴夫，你回家里避避风头吧，血薇帮会在暗中保护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EDC3774C5947034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1222608028:1":{"text":"평생 피해 다닐 수도 없는 노릇이니 하루빨리 밝혀내 주게!!","source_cn":"我可不会避一辈子的风头，你们最好早点调查清楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1BDCC197A9AB63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1222608029:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 데이브의 발언에 특별히 주의할 점이 있었습니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB87150E9FAD53AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 데이브의 발언에 특별히 주의할 점이 있었습니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 데이브의 발언에 특별히 주의할 점이 있었습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"138963","variant_female_record_index":"138964","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:38:1222608029":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 데이브의 발언에 특별히 주의할 점이 있었습니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，关于老戴夫的言论，有什么特别值得注意的地方吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB87150E9FAD53AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 데이브의 발언에 특별히 주의할 점이 있었습니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 데이브의 발언에 특별히 주의할 점이 있었습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"138963","variant_female_record_index":"138964","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1222608030:0":{"text":"음... 그게 보니인지 나라인지, 아니면 또 다른 아름다운 그레이브본인지 단정 짓기 어렵네요.","source_cn":"嗯……很难说那究竟是波妮还是奈拉，又或者是另一位美丽的亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA7478CE4E3EBF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1222608032:1":{"text":"곰곰이 생각해 보니까 보니일 가능성이 더 높은 것 같아요.","source_cn":"我仔细想了想，还是波妮的可能性更高。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1FA62761C47F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1222608033:1":{"text":"보니? 죽음의 함대의 항해사 말인가?","source_cn":"波妮？你是说死潮舰队的大副。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A5B58D135874FB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1222608034:1":{"text":"맞아요. 불사호 전투 때, 보니도 있었으니 바다 밑으로 가라앉은 게 아니라, 운 좋게 도망쳤을지도 모르죠.","source_cn":"对。不死号大战时，波妮也在，也许她并没有葬身海底，而是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E7768C11DD1AE4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1222608035:1":{"text":"루카, 만약 당신이 보니였다면 이제 뭘 하시겠어요?","source_cn":"卢卡，假如你是波妮，你接下来会怎么做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC892CD5D3B60C032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1222608036:1":{"text":"생존자를 모아 힘을 합쳐 호드킨을 위한 복수를 하겠지.","source_cn":"集结幸存者，积蓄力量，为霍德希金复仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A582215F94EE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1222608037:1":{"text":"어디로 갔을까요? 본 베이의 기지로 갔을까요?","source_cn":"她可能去哪里？兽骨滩的基地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE36956AC39047C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1222608038:1":{"text":"아니, 우리가 계속 사람을 보내 본 베이를 감시하고 있어... 스스로 걸려들 정도로 그리 멍청하진 않을 거야.","source_cn":"不，我们一直派人监督着兽骨滩。她如果聪明，不会自投罗网。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00321C7DD30E128A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1222608039:1":{"text":"그렇다면 그린브룩 마을 우물 밑에서 발견한 연구 기지밖에 없는 것 같아요. 죽음의 함대가 그곳에서 실험을 했었으니까요.","source_cn":"那么，就只有我们在绿水村井底发现的研究基地了。死潮舰队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51DE0688A4D8F68C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1222608040:1":{"text":"아주 은밀한 곳인가?","source_cn":"那地方很隐蔽？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FBC2CEAB3FB7EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_